#. Tag: title
#: development.docbook:1598
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Internacionalización"

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:1600
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In order to support full localization, there are several functions to "
#| "translate strings in scripts, namely <literal>i18n</literal>, "
#| "<literal>i18nc</literal>, <literal>i18np</literal> and <literal>i18ncp</"
#| "literal>. These functions behave exactly like <ulink url=\"http://"
#| "techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Localization/i18n\"> KDE's "
#| "translation functions</ulink>."
msgid ""
"In order to support full localization, there are several functions to "
"translate strings in scripts, namely <literal>i18n</literal>, "
"<literal>i18nc</literal>, <literal>i18np</literal> and <literal>i18ncp</"
"literal>. These functions behave exactly like <ulink url=\"http://techbase."
"kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Localization/i18n\"> &kde;'s translation "
"functions</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Para permitir a localización dos scripts, existen diversas funcións: "
"<literal>i18n</literal>, <literal>i18nc</literal>, <literal>i18np</literal> "
"and <literal>i18ncp</literal>. Estas funcións compórtanse exactamente como "
"as <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Localization/"
"i18n\">funcións de internacionalización de KDE</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:1607
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The translation functions translate the wrapped strings through KDE's "
#| "translation system to the language used in the application. Strings in "
#| "scripts being developed in the official &kappname; sources are "
#| "automatically extracted and translatable. In other words, as a &kappname; "
#| "developer you do not have to bother with message extraction and "
#| "translation. However, for 3rd-party scripts developed outside of KDE, you "
#| "have to extract and translate the messages yourself. Along with your "
#| "scripts you have to also distribute a translation catalog, that includes "
#| "all translated strings. Further, your script header then must explicitly "
#| "state the catalog to load by specifying <literal>i18n-catalog</literal>."
msgid ""
"The translation functions translate the wrapped strings through &kde;'s "
"translation system to the language used in the application. Strings in "
"scripts being developed in the official &kappname; sources are automatically "
"extracted and translatable. In other words, as a &kappname; developer you do "
"not have to bother with message extraction and translation. It should be "
"noted though, that the translation only works inside the &kde; "
"infrastructure, &ie;, new strings in 3rd-party scripts developed outside of "
"&kde; are not translated. Therefore, please consider contributing your "
"scripts to &kate; such that proper translation is possible."
msgstr ""
"As funcións de internacionalización utilizan o sistema de tradución de KDE "
"para fornecer a versión das cadeas na lingua na que se executa o aplicativo. "
"As cadeas dos scripts desenvolvidos na versión oficial de &kappname; "
"extráense de maneira automática e póñense a disposición dos tradutores. É "
"dicir, os desenvolvedores de &kappname; non teñen que preocuparse das "
"extracción das mensaxes nin da súa tradución. Porén, no caso dos scripts de "
"terceiros desenvolvidos fóra do paraugas de KDE, deberá extraer e traducir "
"vostede mesmo as mensaxes. Ademais, a cabeceira do seu script deberá indicar "
"o nome do catálogo coas mensaxes traducidas mediante a entrada <literal>i18n-"
"catalog</literal>."

#. Tag: synopsis
#: development.docbook:1619
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void i18n(<parameter>String <replaceable>text</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ...);"
msgstr ""
"void i18n(<parameter>String <replaceable>texto</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …);"

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:1620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Translates <replaceable>text</replaceable> into the language used by the "
"application. The arguments <replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ..., are "
"optional and used to replace the placeholders <literal>%1</literal>, "
"<literal>%2</literal>, etc."
msgstr ""
"Imprime o <replaceable>texto</replaceable> no idioma do aplicativo, de estar "
"dispoñíbel. Os argumentos <replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …, son "
"opcionais e empréganse para substituír as marcas <literal>%1</literal>, "
"<literal>%2</literal>, etc. Estas marcas inclúense no <replaceable>texto</"
"replaceable> para indicar as posicións nas que se inserirán os parámetros na "
"cadea final. Estes parámetros non se traducirán, se ben as traducións do "
"<replaceable>texto</replaceable> terán total liberdade para cambiar a "
"posición na que aparecen."

#. Tag: synopsis
#: development.docbook:1627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void i18nc(<parameter>String <replaceable>context</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<parameter>String <replaceable>text</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ...);"
msgstr ""
"void i18nc(<parameter>String <replaceable>contexto</replaceable></"
"parameter>, <parameter>String <replaceable>texto</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …);"

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:1628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Translates <replaceable>text</replaceable> into the language used by the "
"application. Additionally, the string <replaceable>context</replaceable> is "
"visible to translators so they can provide a better translation. The "
"arguments <replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ..., are optional and used to "
"replace the placeholders <literal>%1</literal>, <literal>%2</literal>, etc."
msgstr ""
"Imprime o <replaceable>texto</replaceable> no idioma do aplicativo, de estar "
"dispoñíbel. Ademais, a cadea de texto <replaceable>context</replaceable> "
"poderán vela os tradutores, para poder fornecer mellores traducións. Os "
"argumentos <replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …, son opcionais e "
"empréganse para substituír as marcas <literal>%1</literal>, <literal>%2</"
"literal>, etc."

#. Tag: synopsis
#: development.docbook:1637
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void i18np(<parameter>String <replaceable>singular</replaceable></"
"parameter>, <parameter>String <replaceable>plural</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<parameter>int <replaceable>number</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ...);"
msgstr ""
"void i18np(<parameter>String <replaceable>singular</replaceable></"
"parameter>, <parameter>String <replaceable>plural</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<parameter>int <replaceable>número</replaceable></parameter>, "
"<replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …);"

#. Tag: para
#: development.docbook:1638
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Translates either <replaceable>singular</replaceable> or "
"<replaceable>plural</replaceable> into the language used by the application, "
"depending on the given <replaceable>number</replaceable>. The arguments "
"<replaceable>arg1</replaceable>, ..., are optional and used to replace the "
"placeholders <literal>%1</literal>, <literal>%2</literal>, etc."
msgstr ""
"Imprime a versión <replaceable>singular</replaceable> ou "
"<replaceable>plural</replaceable> do <replaceable>texto</replaceable> —"
"dependendo do <replaceable>número</replaceable>— no idioma do aplicativo, de "
"estar dispoñíbel. Os argumentos <replaceable>argumento1</replaceable>, …, "
"son opcionais e empréganse para substituír as marcas <literal>%1</literal>, "
"<literal>%2</literal>, etc. Estas marcas inclúense no <replaceable>texto</"
"replaceable> para indicar as posicións nas que se inserirán os parámetros na "
"cadea final. Estes parámetros non se traducirán, se ben as traducións do "
"<replaceable>texto</replaceable> terán total liberdade para cambiar a "
"posición na que aparecen."

